cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Rice-skills in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "Rice-skills: all-omics + genomics + breeding analysis skill package for rice"
abstract: >-
  An open-source skill package for rice (Oryza sativa) covering transcriptomics,
  metabolomics and their integration, GWAS, population genetics, pangenome, QTL,
  proteomics, epigenomics, phenomics, single-cell and spatial omics, gene-family
  evolution, and CRISPR/primer design, with causal inference (TWAS/MR/fine-mapping),
  single-cell/spatial analysis and base/prime editing design. 18 analysis modules,
  130 R/Python scripts plus 23 shell wrappers, with built-in demo self-tests,
  publication-grade figures, and 541 curated third-party agent skills.
version: 3.12.0
